# =====================================================================
# KDM CONTENT POLICY — never commit gameplay artifacts (see README).
# Card IMAGES/ART and player-scanned AI / Hit-Location deck data are
# host-provided, session-local, and MUST NOT be source-controlled.
# Shippable "Scribe-scope" mechanical packs live in content/packs/.
# =====================================================================
content/assets/
!content/assets/.gitkeep
content/scans/
# host-provided mechanical decks (e.g. hit-location) — never source-controlled
content/local/
*.kdmscan
# Card art must never be committed anywhere (Bring Your Own Cards). Ignore raster image
# formats repo-wide, then allow the app's own (non-KDM) UI assets back in.
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.webp
*.heic
*.heif
*.tif
*.tiff
*.gif
*.bmp
*.PNG
*.JPG
*.JPEG
*.WEBP
!web/src/assets/**
!web/public/**
